# Fusecheck fixture (scripts/fusecheck-check.sh --selftest): the count
# EXCEEDS the two-sided max — 2 bodies against a 1..1 bound — so fusecheck
# exits 4 and the row is a hard FAIL, never a WARN (the too-many exit is
# never downgraded).
assert fusecheck-fixtures-separable.stl 1 1
# Mandatory negative control.
control fused 1
